# OpenVFD - front-panel display driver for Android TV boxes.
#
config OPENVFD
	tristate "OpenVFD front panel LED/segment display"
	depends on OF && GPIOLIB
	help
	  Driver for the small front-panel displays found on many Android TV
	  boxes: FD628/FD650 7-segment controllers driven by a clock/data GPIO
	  pair, plus HD44780, SSD1306, PCD8544 and IL3829 panels.  Exposes
	  /dev/openvfd; the userspace daemon writes the time/status to it.

	  Say M here. The module is only packaged for the board that has such a
	  display (JP TV Box 3566); the device tree node is "open,vfd".
